WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.208 --> 00:00:04.333
Yo planté los bichos.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Salir.

3
00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:07.291
Sí, Alfa.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.125
Lo odio.

5
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.458
Él es el enemigo.

6
00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:37.916
Fóllame.

7
00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:46.291
Necesito odiarte.

8
00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:48.416
Necesito...

9
00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:52.458
Guardabosques.
